 "description": "The jabberwock's AGNOSTIC avatar tracking (value-preserving translation). Colour-keying FAILED live (the avatar's colour-aggregate was mostly static \u2014 a cursor moving through a recolouring field). FIX: ask PER CELL 'did your value leave you and reappear one-d away?' \u2014 the host emits an AvatarMotion node = the value-preserving-shifted cells (value left c AND arrived at c+d) for the action's known displacement d; these ARE the avatar, isolated from any field that recoloured IN PLACE (recolour never reappears at +d; a static cell never changes). No colour/size/cluster assumption. avatar_vps_track confirms+tracks (streak, centroid); avatar_bootstrap_confirm latches is_avatar at streak>=2. predicted_overlap stays authored but the VPS test is more direct (self-discriminating: overlap-at-no-shift is empty by construction).",
